This product (hukuhaka-codex) is a modified distribution of the OpenAI
Codex plugin for Claude Code.

Copyright 2026 hukuhaka

Modifications by hukuhaka (NOT endorsed by OpenAI):
- Renamed the plugin to "hukuhaka-codex".
- Added orchestration commands: plan, review-loop, duel, debate, and full.
- Added the internal "codex-plan" skill (read-only plan prompt contract and
  the Claude-side implement handoff).
- Adapted the upstream model-specific prompting skill as model-neutral
  "codex-prompting" guidance, while moving plan ownership into "codex-plan".
- Changed rescue and proactive behavior to be read-only by default and added
  opt-in five-minute Bash failure detection, report-only stop review, and
  Stop-continuation loop prevention.
- Added Codex CLI runtime fingerprinting so a broker created by an older CLI
  is recycled after an upgrade.
- Adapted app-server initialization and startup errors for newer Codex CLI
  protocol behavior.
- Adopted upstream Git shell-expansion hardening.

The fork retains upstream runtime, agent, hook, prompt, schema, command, and
skill files where applicable, with namespace and behavior changes documented
in UPSTREAM-SYNC.md. All modifications are licensed under the same Apache
License, Version 2.0.
